      "content": "I really need to keep this professional for my technical report, so please skip the goblin metaphors. Can we focus on the physics? You mentioned microstructural defects—could those defects be causing non-uniform thermal conductivity across the pad surface, and how would that lead to the localized hot spots we're seeing in the telemetry?",
